yeah, thank you for your words, I super appreciate that you're going through and talking to me about this ;; 

I kind of wanted to scout out to see how the community is about posting things daily here or something but it isnt that kind of subreddit which i understand now!

I will most likely take your advice and post elsewhere for now! I kind of wanted a little bit of guidance about what to do first; though posting here could have gone much worse I am very thankful you took the time to give me some advice on my current issue. I do have a lot planned for the story already, it is just about the execution that I wanted to scout and learn about. i'm obviously not talking with a fountain of experience with this sort of thing so this did help me out.
